WEBVTT

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.792
Tsugumi...

00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:50.250
It's almost time for supper,

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.042
so can you put that away and call your brother?

00:00:53.042 --> 00:00:54.458
Okay.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:22.125
What is this?

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:24.333
Oh, my...

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:27.042
Miss Harudori, are you really going to DWMA?

00:01:27.042 --> 00:01:29.125
Uh, mm-hmm.

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.667
Amazing!

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:31.875
That's so elite, isn't it?

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:33.875
--DWMA is in America, right?
--It's your chance to find a rich husband!

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:36.167
Are you going to fight witches and stuff?

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:38.333
I'm not doing anything like that.

00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:40.917
Say, you can become a weapon, right?

00:01:40.917 --> 00:01:43.667
It's not so much that I <i>can </i>as that I <i>do</i>.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:45.000
Become it now!

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.375
Now? No, I can't do it so suddenly.

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:49.417
Why not?

00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:51.083
I want to see it, too!

00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:52.250
I mean, a weapon!

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.667
Isn't that cool?

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:56.750
It's not really that cool...

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:00.250
--It's not that easy to transform...
--Miss?

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:03.208
Ladies and gentlemen, we will be
arriving at Death City Airport soon.

00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:06.375
--We are about to land, so please return your tray table.
--The local weather conditions are clear.

00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:09.208
--Oh, right.
--The temperature is 28 degrees Celsius.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.958
"DWMA New Student Handbook"

00:02:23.708 --> 00:02:30.333
<i>we wanna be there even if we had to</i>
<i>twist the world all around to get there</i>

00:02:30.333 --> 00:02:41.208
<i>without you, i guess i couldn't</i>
<i>even find the future here today</i>

00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:52.167
<i>i was always trying to take nothing for granted</i>

00:02:52.167 --> 00:03:00.167
<i>for the day i might lose them</i>

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:07.250
<i>but you just came in to my black</i>
<i>and white monochrome destiny</i>

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:17.417
<i>and colored it all over</i>

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:24.792
<i>we won't be satisfied with the routine future</i>

00:03:24.792 --> 00:03:32.208
<i>we were born to make a new history come true</i>

00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:39.375
<i>there's absolutely no</i>
<i>absolute thing in this world</i>

00:03:39.375 --> 00:03:43.958
<i>this road goes on forever</i>

00:03:43.958 --> 00:03:50.125
<i>as long as we won't give up</i>

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.042
Young lady, are you here sightseeing?

00:03:56.042 --> 00:03:57.375
Come hop in a taxi!

00:03:57.375 --> 00:04:00.292
--No, um, I'm taking a bus...
--When you come to Death City, you just have to buy one of these!

00:04:00.292 --> 00:04:02.083
That's okay, I've got all I need.

00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:05.833
Here, young lady, this will
make you a proper Death-girl!

00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:09.208
Young lady, do you need a taxi? Hop right on in!

00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:15.583
I will not get in such an unacceptable vehicle!

00:04:15.583 --> 00:04:17.583
Um, excuse me...

00:04:17.583 --> 00:04:19.292
Yes, how can I help you?

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:23.208
Where did I come from, and where am I going?

00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:23.875
Huh?

00:04:23.958 --> 00:04:27.000
"Enrolling at DWMA!"

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:55.500
The famous long staircase in front of the
school is for building tough leg muscles...

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.917
Huh?!

00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:09.417
I think I might die first.

00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:30.417
It's so hot! I should have brought some tea.

00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:52.292
It's just a little farther. Hang in there!

00:05:53.667 --> 00:05:54.917
See you!

00:05:54.917 --> 00:05:57.833
Oh... thank you very much...

00:05:59.833 --> 00:06:03.583
She's so cool. I wonder if she's a student here.

00:06:05.292 --> 00:06:08.875
It's just a little farther, then? All right!

00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:19.875
My... My knees are about to crack up...

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:23.167
Hey, knees, you too?

00:06:23.167 --> 00:06:26.917
Am I at an age where I can
laugh at the slightest thing?

00:06:32.708 --> 00:06:35.417
I made it!

00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:38.208
Huh?

00:06:42.708 --> 00:06:46.375
Is this from that other
student earlier? What is it?

00:06:46.375 --> 00:06:48.375
"Welcome to DWMA!!"

00:06:48.375 --> 00:06:49.250
"Turn around!"

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.208
Turn around?

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.667
This is Death City!

00:07:05.792 --> 00:07:11.167
And this... is the school
I'm going to from now on, DWMA!

00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:22.458
What is this? It tastes weird!
It's the taste of America!

00:07:22.458 --> 00:07:27.000
Death Weapon Meister Academy,
popularly known as DWMA.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:31.417
It's a school that trains the
heroes that preserve world peace.

00:07:31.417 --> 00:07:34.125
Its students include weapons and meisters.

00:07:34.125 --> 00:07:38.417
Those who are weapons are people who
possess the ability to transform into weapons.

00:07:38.417 --> 00:07:43.000
Those who are meisters are the people
who use those weapons to fight with.

00:07:44.792 --> 00:07:47.542
That last combination worked well, huh?

00:07:47.542 --> 00:07:51.417
Let's test it out one more time
before we forget how it felt.

00:07:51.417 --> 00:07:56.333
--Yeah. There should be some more room for improvement, too.
--The weapon is talking. That weapon is a person.

00:08:00.458 --> 00:08:02.833
I'm taking all of the contract money I'm getting

00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:06.625
from this latest sponsored event
and donating it for the children.

00:08:08.958 --> 00:08:12.292
How cool. I wonder if he's famous.

00:08:14.958 --> 00:08:18.625
I'd like to donate all of my contract fees.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.625
Would you like to be my partner?

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:24.292
No, be <i>my </i>partner.

00:08:24.292 --> 00:08:26.542
I'm a 14-year-old who's in love with love...

00:08:26.542 --> 00:08:28.458
I've never even had a male friend before,

00:08:28.458 --> 00:08:31.208
and suddenly, I'm in a love triangle.

00:08:32.625 --> 00:08:35.792
Not you! Not in a hundred years!

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.208
I'll kill you.

00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:45.333
Eep! I'm sorry! I'm dreaming far too much!

00:08:47.667 --> 00:08:48.625
What was that about?

00:08:48.625 --> 00:08:52.167
She's an unfamiliar face, huh?
Maybe she's a freshman.

00:08:52.167 --> 00:08:54.833
I'll bet she wanted my autograph.

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:56.042
No she didn't.

00:08:56.958 --> 00:09:01.750
Whew... For better or worse, this is a big deal.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:06.000
Why did I have to be a weapon?

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:07.667
I want to go home.

00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:10.167
I want to go home! I want to
go home! I want to go home!

00:09:10.167 --> 00:09:12.125
I want to go home! I want to go home!

00:09:13.667 --> 00:09:15.292
I can't go home!

00:09:17.083 --> 00:09:18.958
Hmph, let's go!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:25.208
The inside of this school is like a maze.

00:09:26.417 --> 00:09:28.167
I'm lost?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.500
"Welcome to DWMA!!
Freshman Orientation & Get-Together"

00:09:42.542 --> 00:09:44.750
Here, I slipped out of that cramped castle,

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.250
and came to see the commoner's world,

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.583
but this was the wrong choice.

00:09:52.083 --> 00:09:54.917
There's no way the commoners that I'm picturing

00:09:54.917 --> 00:09:58.042
would be in a specialized
school like this, is there?

00:09:58.042 --> 00:10:00.042
I'm such a birdbrain!

00:10:01.792 --> 00:10:05.417
There's a lot about the
students here that is so unusual.

00:10:05.417 --> 00:10:07.750
Excuse me.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.625
I'm sorry I'm late. I got lost.

00:10:10.625 --> 00:10:11.583
New student?

00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:14.917
Oh, yes. Tsugumi Harudori.

00:10:14.917 --> 00:10:16.500
There's a commoner!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.083
--Weapon or meister?
--Her hairstyle asserts nothing.

00:10:18.083 --> 00:10:20.458
--Um, weapon.
--She has no figure to speak of.

00:10:20.458 --> 00:10:22.042
And despite the overwhelming lack of aura,

00:10:22.042 --> 00:10:22.958
--she has the adorable smile of
someone who isn't at all concerned.

00:10:22.958 --> 00:10:24.583
--Put this on your chest.
--she has the adorable smile of someone who isn't at all concerned.

00:10:24.583 --> 00:10:26.250
--Right.
--she has the adorable smile of someone who isn't at all concerned.

00:10:31.083 --> 00:10:33.167
Looks like we barely made it.

00:10:38.375 --> 00:10:41.042
Ah... I'm so jealous...

00:10:41.042 --> 00:10:44.000
Oh, I'm so sorry! Are you all right?

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:48.292
Yes, I'm fine. Absolutely.

00:10:48.292 --> 00:10:50.042
Oh, your ribbon...

00:10:53.917 --> 00:10:54.667
Here.

00:10:54.667 --> 00:10:56.375
Thanks.

00:10:57.667 --> 00:11:02.083
On top? I thought you had
it on your left side earlier.

00:11:02.083 --> 00:11:03.917
I did?

00:11:08.292 --> 00:11:11.000
I'm Tsugumi Harudori.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.875
As in Tsugumi, the "bird of spring"?

00:11:13.875 --> 00:11:14.958
Yes.

00:11:14.958 --> 00:11:16.625
I'm...

00:11:17.292 --> 00:11:20.958
Huh? Let's see...

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:23.833
I've forgotten my name.

00:11:23.833 --> 00:11:25.833
Huh? Your name?!

00:11:25.833 --> 00:11:31.667
Ah! I remembered it! I'm Meme.
Meme Tatane. Pleased to meet you.

00:11:31.667 --> 00:11:36.167
--Miss Meme, is it? To forget your own name is beyond zoned out.
--That's it. That's the kind of commoner I've been looking for.

00:11:36.167 --> 00:11:37.875
--I'm just absent-minded.
--That's it. That's the kind of commoner I've been looking for.

00:11:37.875 --> 00:11:39.667
Absent-minded?

00:11:44.417 --> 00:11:47.667
Such a pretty girl. Almost like a princess.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.292
Gagantous!

00:11:53.292 --> 00:11:54.917
"Gagantous"?

00:11:55.792 --> 00:11:57.833
That's everyone, right?

00:11:57.833 --> 00:12:02.125
Welcome to DWMA.
I'm Sid, one of the teachers here.

00:12:02.125 --> 00:12:04.375
There are those of you here
who transform into weapons,

00:12:04.375 --> 00:12:08.792
and those of you who wish to be
meisters, who fight with the weapons.

00:12:08.792 --> 00:12:11.167
There are probably those
of you among the weapons

00:12:11.167 --> 00:12:13.833
who are not yet able to
transform under your own will yet.

00:12:13.833 --> 00:12:18.042
But there is no rush. This is the
school where you will learn that.

00:12:18.042 --> 00:12:19.458
How lame.

00:12:19.458 --> 00:12:21.500
You got people like that here?

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:25.542
From here on, you will have to choose partners--

00:12:25.542 --> 00:12:27.958
meisters with weapons,
and weapons with meisters.

00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:29.292
Partners?

00:12:29.292 --> 00:12:32.292
For still-inexperienced weapons in particular,

00:12:32.292 --> 00:12:34.917
the meister you partner with is important.

00:12:34.917 --> 00:12:37.708
Just as one cannot become
a parent without a child,

00:12:37.708 --> 00:12:42.292
without a meister that can use a weapon,
it will be difficult to become a weapon.

00:12:42.292 --> 00:12:45.708
Take your time and find a partner
you have good chemistry with.

00:12:45.708 --> 00:12:46.708
What should we do?

00:12:46.708 --> 00:12:49.083
I know I want a girl.

00:12:49.083 --> 00:12:51.583
If both of us are guys, I'll have
to go to the filthy boys' dorms,

00:12:51.583 --> 00:12:54.833
and having a girl partner
seems like it will be easier.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.292
I'm not an eloquent man.

00:12:58.292 --> 00:13:01.417
I think it will be quicker for you to understand

00:13:01.417 --> 00:13:04.750
if you actually see partners with
matching wavelengths for yourselves.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.375
Come on in.

00:13:14.583 --> 00:13:17.625
These are your seniors, the meister Maka Albarn,

00:13:17.625 --> 00:13:20.000
and the weapon Soul Eater.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.917
Nice to meet you all. I'm Maka.

00:13:28.792 --> 00:13:30.958
She remembers me.

00:13:32.292 --> 00:13:34.708
Okay, you two, begin.

00:13:42.917 --> 00:13:44.625
He transformed into a weapon!

00:13:44.625 --> 00:13:47.375
Miss Harudori, you're a weapon too, aren't you?

00:13:47.375 --> 00:13:51.500
Oh... I still can't do it like that...

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:56.292
The weapon and meister are both people.
That is not just a "thing."

00:13:56.292 --> 00:13:59.000
If we acknowledge each
other's wills and match our breathing,

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.083
then without even any added force...

00:14:01.083 --> 00:14:02.458
...he'll move!

00:14:11.125 --> 00:14:12.667
Amazing...

00:14:18.083 --> 00:14:20.542
It's like the two of them are dancing.

00:14:41.125 --> 00:14:43.833
This is a weapon and meister partnership.

00:14:43.833 --> 00:14:47.292
You will learn all about it
little by little in your classes.

00:14:47.292 --> 00:14:49.917
Right now, just sense out your feelings.

00:14:49.917 --> 00:14:52.625
That's all for today. You are dismissed.

00:14:52.625 --> 00:14:56.417
Wasn't that amazing? I'm surprised
by how all of the upperclassmen

00:14:56.417 --> 00:14:59.167
here at DWMA are so incredible--

00:15:10.333 --> 00:15:11.708
Miss Meme!

00:15:12.583 --> 00:15:17.417
Hey, you're a meister, right?
How about pairing with me?

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:21.042
I may not look it, but I'm
a pretty awesome weapon.

00:15:21.042 --> 00:15:22.875
--Well, um...
--You will, right?

00:15:22.875 --> 00:15:24.542
What are you looking at?

00:15:24.542 --> 00:15:26.583
Oh, nothing.

00:15:26.583 --> 00:15:29.708
Hmph, you wanna partner with me?

00:15:29.708 --> 00:15:31.625
No.

00:15:45.583 --> 00:15:50.583
I can't do this. I've been going
to a regular school up to now.

00:15:50.583 --> 00:15:53.000
I'm just a normal middle-schooler.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:57.042
Just because I've come to DWMA
doesn't mean I'm suddenly a hero.

00:15:58.083 --> 00:16:00.458
I'm sorry, Miss Meme.

00:16:05.167 --> 00:16:12.250
But if I just leave like this,
I'll never be friends with Miss Meme, huh?

00:16:15.667 --> 00:16:19.292
I wonder what that student
would have done in this situation.

00:16:28.542 --> 00:16:32.625
You won't be sorry. Team up with me. Okay?

00:16:32.625 --> 00:16:33.833
No, thanks.

00:16:33.833 --> 00:16:37.292
How heartbreaking. Why don't
we get to know each other better?

00:16:37.292 --> 00:16:38.958
Miss Meme!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.250
Let's go!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.792
Miss Harudori!

00:16:48.167 --> 00:16:52.000
That girl is the one that he's inviting.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:55.042
--He has no use for a flat-chested girl like you.
--Flat-chested?!

00:16:55.042 --> 00:16:58.375
I can tell. Even when you
grow up, you'll stay the same.

00:16:58.375 --> 00:17:02.000
--Ha-ha-ha! That's for sure! Now that that's clear, get lost.
--Commoner-sized mammaries--

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.667
"Commaries."

00:17:08.083 --> 00:17:09.458
What do you want?

00:17:09.458 --> 00:17:12.750
Stay out of this. We're just
asking to be partners, right?

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.792
Hmph, you boor.

00:17:14.792 --> 00:17:15.625
Huh?!

00:17:15.625 --> 00:17:17.667
Are you looking for a fight?!

00:17:17.667 --> 00:17:21.292
Actions do the talking here at DWMA! Let's go!

00:17:21.292 --> 00:17:24.000
Fascinating. All right,
let's do this, why don't we?

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.167
Eh?!

00:17:25.167 --> 00:17:26.792
I won't go easy, just because you're a girl--

00:17:26.792 --> 00:17:29.958
Spare me the embarrassing puffery.

00:17:30.958 --> 00:17:35.042
Miss Harudori, was it? You're a weapon, right?

00:17:35.042 --> 00:17:36.667
Please, transform yourself at once.

00:17:36.667 --> 00:17:42.000
Huh? But I still can't transform properly.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:45.292
If you can't transform, then go on home!

00:17:48.667 --> 00:17:49.958
Hey!

00:17:49.958 --> 00:17:52.125
Oh, let's have a look.

00:17:52.125 --> 00:17:55.083
Their school life is just getting started, after all.

00:17:55.083 --> 00:17:57.708
What is this? Trouble already?

00:17:57.708 --> 00:18:00.208
Well, it is this kind of school, after all.

00:18:00.208 --> 00:18:03.042
You're not going to stop them, Sid-<i>sensei</i>?

00:18:03.042 --> 00:18:06.375
Nah, it is this kind of school, after all.

00:18:06.375 --> 00:18:11.042
This fight is over before
it's even started. Transform!

00:18:14.375 --> 00:18:19.208
How 'bout that?! I can completely
transform everything but my head!

00:18:19.208 --> 00:18:20.625
So close.

00:18:20.958 --> 00:18:25.167
If you don't hurry up and
transform, too, we'll get beaten up.

00:18:25.167 --> 00:18:30.167
But I can't. Not when
I'm suddenly asked to do so.

00:18:30.167 --> 00:18:36.250
I heard that commoners...
were strong, powerful, cheerful, fun people.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:40.625
But you do not seem to be
that way. How disappointing.

00:18:41.792 --> 00:18:44.333
So you don't need a weapon, then?

00:18:48.458 --> 00:18:53.042
Weapon or not, I am not going
to fall behind the likes of you!

00:18:55.417 --> 00:18:57.375
Imagine it!

00:18:57.375 --> 00:19:00.458
The sharp blade lying dormant within your soul!

00:19:00.458 --> 00:19:04.167
Awaken it! For the sake of
what you believe to be right!

00:19:04.167 --> 00:19:07.000
Starting today, you are a student at DWMA!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.708
Imagine it?

00:19:11.708 --> 00:19:15.042
The blade lying dormant within my soul?

00:19:20.583 --> 00:19:24.417
I didn't become a weapon because I wanted to.

00:19:24.417 --> 00:19:29.667
Why me? I hate being afraid. I want to go home.

00:19:29.667 --> 00:19:33.625
I can't do this. Please, lay off of me.

00:19:35.292 --> 00:19:38.625
For what reason have I come here?

00:19:38.625 --> 00:19:42.833
I have to fight... I have to protect...

00:19:42.833 --> 00:19:47.625
It's okay. Open your eyes, Tsugumi Harudori.

00:19:47.625 --> 00:19:49.833
I am a weapon!

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.500
Is this... me?!

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.167
That's a halberd.

00:20:18.167 --> 00:20:20.333
You can do it if you try, can't you?

00:20:20.333 --> 00:20:22.542
Look at that, you've got no blade.

00:20:23.542 --> 00:20:26.375
I'm sorry I took so long!

00:20:26.375 --> 00:20:27.958
Here we go!

00:20:41.542 --> 00:20:42.542
Keep calm!

00:20:42.542 --> 00:20:43.625
Right!

00:21:01.708 --> 00:21:05.208
We have two injured students.
Someone go to the nurse's office,

00:21:05.208 --> 00:21:07.458
and ask Medusa-<i>sensei </i>to come here.

00:21:07.458 --> 00:21:09.458
Okay, I'll go.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:23.042
Thank you very much, Miss Kamome Umi-dori.
[Seagull Sea-bird]

00:21:23.917 --> 00:21:25.833
It's Tsugumi Harudori.
[Thrush Spring-bird]

00:21:25.833 --> 00:21:28.750
Oh, I'm sorry, Miss Harudori.

00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:34.208
Hmm, I got helped out, myself.
If you want to thank anyone...

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:38.375
It's Anya.

00:21:38.375 --> 00:21:41.417
Thank you very much, Miss Anya.

00:21:42.125 --> 00:21:44.417
Hmph.

00:21:44.417 --> 00:21:46.917
Miss Harudori, I have a favor to ask.

00:21:46.917 --> 00:21:48.250
Yes?

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:53.625
I'm a bit dense, and might
cause you all sorts of trouble...

00:21:53.625 --> 00:21:56.625
...but would you like to be my partner?

00:21:56.625 --> 00:21:58.708
--Huh? Me?
--Huh?

00:21:59.917 --> 00:22:04.458
If you'll have me, I'd be glad to-- Oh, but...

00:22:04.458 --> 00:22:08.708
Why should I have to pair up
with a commoner like you?

00:22:08.708 --> 00:22:11.375
In fact, you're unwelcome. If I paired with you,

00:22:11.375 --> 00:22:14.292
your commary-sized bust might spread to me, too!

00:22:14.292 --> 00:22:15.917
Gagantous!

00:22:16.792 --> 00:22:19.958
Well then, is that settled?

00:22:19.958 --> 00:22:21.750
Mm-hmm, glad to have you.

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:24.292
Yes, I am glad to have you, as well!

00:22:38.583 --> 00:22:41.208
I'm a 14-year-old who's in love with love,

00:22:41.208 --> 00:22:46.000
but this is not the triangle
I expected to be in.

00:22:47.417 --> 00:22:51.583
<i>With a big wave and a "See you,"</i>

00:22:51.583 --> 00:22:58.333
<i>let's meet in the new day</i>

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:19.417
<i>Our shadows stretch along the pavement</i>

00:23:19.417 --> 00:23:23.375
<i>coming together, then apart, then together</i>

00:23:23.375 --> 00:23:31.750
<i>What do I say when the road home ends?</i>

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:35.875
<i>You are not alone. Nope, right nearby,</i>

00:23:35.875 --> 00:23:40.042
<i>there are eyes looking back at you</i>

00:23:40.042 --> 00:23:44.167
<i>And just like a miracle,</i>

00:23:44.167 --> 00:23:47.917
<i>they can turn even failures into laughter</i>

00:23:47.917 --> 00:23:52.042
<i>Thank you for a fun day</i>

00:23:52.042 --> 00:23:56.167
<i>Let's do it again tomorrow</i>

00:23:56.167 --> 00:24:00.458
<i>We'll open a brand-new door</i>

00:24:00.458 --> 00:24:04.500
<i>chasing after dreams and love</i>

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:09.833
<i>and those nameless feelings, too</i>

00:24:17.750 --> 00:24:20.292
What awaits us when
we arrive at the girls' dorm?

00:24:20.292 --> 00:24:21.958
Witches? Calamity?

00:24:21.958 --> 00:24:24.750
No, stop! I'm not Mary!

00:24:24.750 --> 00:24:26.792
What are you doing, Miss Tsugumi?

00:24:26.792 --> 00:24:28.250
Time to go to work.

00:24:28.250 --> 00:24:29.708
Ah, wait!

00:24:29.708 --> 00:24:32.107
"Next time: Girls' Dorms à la Carte!"
